{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_hkk_18_1","chapterId":"ch_work_hkk_18","text":"虎鈐經","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_hkk_18_2","chapterId":"ch_work_hkk_18","text":"卷十六卷十六","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_hkk_18_3","chapterId":"ch_work_hkk_18","text":"○分野統論第一百五十六","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_hkk_18_4","chapterId":"ch_work_hkk_18","text":"《易》曰：天垂象，聖人則之。又曰：仰以觀乎天文，俯以察乎地理。此皆前聖人洞吉凶興亡之道，然而天文、地理、兵象之要略，得不審而用之哉？行師之际，五星伏没、遲順兩曜、盈虧薄食、飛流示变、孛彗為妖，既知之矣，必審必詳所居躔度焉。其躔度既詳之矣，必審所管分野焉。苟如是，方可以精別灾異，順其舉動而已矣。今臣辄上據天文，下推地理，以別十二分野。外以觀星辰之变，內以備山川之用，天地之間，燦然在目。其圖其状，以示於來者焉。","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_hkk_18_5","chapterId":"ch_work_hkk_18","text":"○老人星第一百五十七","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_hkk_18_6","chapterId":"ch_work_hkk_18","text":"○大火第一百五十八","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_hkk_18_7","chapterId":"ch_work_hkk_18","text":"○析木第一百五十九","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_hkk_18_8","chapterId":"ch_work_hkk_18","text":"○星紀第一百六十","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_hkk_18_9","chapterId":"ch_work_hkk_18","text":"○元枵第一百六十一","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_hkk_18_10","chapterId":"ch_work_hkk_18","text":"○诹訾第一百六十二","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_hkk_18_11","chapterId":"ch_work_hkk_18","text":"○降娄第一百六十三","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_hkk_18_12","chapterId":"ch_work_hkk_18","text":"○大梁第一百六十四","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_hkk_18_13","chapterId":"ch_work_hkk_18","text":"○實沈第一百六十五","sortOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_hkk_18_14","chapterId":"ch_work_hkk_18","text":"原缺","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_hkk_18_15","chapterId":"ch_work_hkk_18","text":"○鶉首第一百六十六","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_hkk_18_16","chapterId":"ch_work_hkk_18","text":"原缺","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_hkk_18_17","chapterId":"ch_work_hkk_18","text":"○鶉火第一百六十七","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_hkk_18_18","chapterId":"ch_work_hkk_18","text":"原缺","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_hkk_18_19","chapterId":"ch_work_hkk_18","text":"○鶉尾第一百六十八","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_hkk_18_20","chapterId":"ch_work_hkk_18","text":"原缺","sortOrder":20}],"overrides":{}}